sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant KR as Keyring (service-scoped)
    participant PR as Provider
    participant ZK as zalando/go-keyring
    participant OS as OS Keyring

    Note over App,OS: Setup / Initialization
    App->>KR: NewKeyring("my-app")
    activate KR
    KR->>PR: Set(service, "_probe", "test")
    PR->>ZK: Set(service, "_probe", "test")
    ZK->>OS: Store Secret
    OS-->>ZK: Success
    ZK-->>PR: nil
    PR-->>KR: nil
    KR-->>App: *Keyring
    deactivate KR

    Note over App,OS: Write / Read / Rotate
    App->>KR: Set(key, value)
    KR->>PR: Set(service, key, value)
    PR->>ZK: Set(service, key, value)
    ZK->>OS: Store Secret
    OS-->>ZK: Success
    ZK-->>KR: nil

    App->>KR: Get(key)
    KR->>PR: Get(service, key)
    PR->>ZK: Get(service, key)
    ZK->>OS: Retrieve Secret
    OS-->>ZK: value
    ZK-->>KR: value
    KR-->>App: value

    Note over App,OS: KeyManager delegates to a Keyring<br/>scoped to ServiceName (updater-cicd)
    App->>KR: KeyManager.Setup / Rotate / DeleteAll